      </div>
      <div class="entry-date">2025</div>
    </div>
    <ul class="entry-desc">
      <li>Built full-stack brand website for Liquid Gold Coffee — React,
 TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, server + client 
architecture.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">React</span><span class="tag">TypeScript</span><span class="tag">Vite</span><span class="tag">Tailwind</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <div class="entry-header">
      <div>
        <div class="entry-title">Security Researcher — Android Fintech</div>
        <div class="entry-org">Independent Research · East Africa</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-date">2025</div>
    </div>
    <ul class="entry-desc">
      <li>Reverse engineered M-Pesa, NCBA, PayPal, and Safaricom Android
 applications across an 83GB Samsung device corpus using jadx and 
