    <ul class="entry-desc">
      <li>CHAI: Led 5-person cross-functional team to Top 25 finish out 
of 500+ teams from 2,000+ applicants. Owned end-to-end security 
architecture and product alignment.</li>
      <li>IBM watsonx: Built Qonvergence — multi-agent AI ecosystem project integrating Watson services.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</section>

